insight_discoveries_w10.2_w12:
  - id: D4
    finding: "Bulk sed-style migrations are NEVER safe across 165K LoC. The cascade errors (AHashMap duplication, ahash aliases, struct field type mismatches) only surfaced after apply, not in dry-run."
    impact: "ADR-0018 documents 3 safer alternatives: (A) remove policy, (B) surgical migration, (C) opt-in feature."
  - id: D5
    finding: "src/ is NOT legacy — it's the v2.x compat shim. The 427 files re-export from crates/. Removing them would break v2.x consumers."
    impact: "W11.1.1: deletion task → documentation task. ADR-0019 formalizes the architecture."
  - id: D6
    finding: "Many Master Plan tasks were REDUNDANT (work already done). Async foundations in kazuba-rlm predate the plan. Rayon 1.10 is everywhere. PyO3 Bound<'py, T> is already adopted."
    impact: "W12 scope reduced from 12h to ~2h. Reallocated to higher-value items."

